cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software and the associated paper when using these calculations."
type: software
title: "Entropy products beyond the attractor: scientific code and data"
authors:
  - family-names: Goldstein
    given-names: Kevin
  - family-names: Jejjala
    given-names: Vishnu
  - family-names: Nampuri
    given-names: Suresh
version: "2026.11.03-prl5"
abstract: >-
  Numerical and symbolic calculations of conserved black-hole entropy products,
  deficits and excesses relative to the extremal reference, fixed-coupling
  families, scalar focusing, entropy-gap bounds and near-horizon geometries.
  This package preserves scientific snapshot 2026.11.02-r5 and includes
  the corresponding PRL figure scripts and reference data.
keywords:
  - black holes
  - entropy
  - numerical relativity
  - symbolic computation
